SUMMARY:Deadline 15:00 CET: Fonds voor Cultuurparticipatie: Open Call Cultu
 ral Education and Digital Technology 2026
DESCRIPTION:Closes 16 Dec 2026 at 15:00 CET.\n\nOpen call (Open Oproep Cult
 uureducatie en Digitale Technologie) for cultural education projects in wh
 ich children and young people work creatively with digital technology. Run
  by the Fonds voor Cultuurparticipatie with LKCA and DEN.\n\nOrganisation:
  Fonds voor Cultuurparticipatie (with LKCA and DEN)\nLocation: Amsterdam\,
  Friesland\, Noord-Brabant or Caribbean Netherlands (Bonaire\, Saba\, Sint
  Eustatius)\; applicant must be based in one of these regions\nAward: EUR 
 10\,000 to EUR 25\,000 per project\, up to 100% of total project costs (no
  co-funding required). Total budget EUR 500\,000.\nDuration: Project start
 s between 10 March and 10 May 2027 and runs for at most one year.\n\nMore:
  https://www.cultuurparticipatie.nl/subsidie/open-oproep-cultuureducatie-e
 n-digitale-technologie/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
URL:https://www.cultuurparticipatie.nl/subsidie/open-oproep-cultuureducatie
 -en-digitale-technologie/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium
 =referral
LOCATION:Amsterdam\, Friesland\, Noord-Brabant or Caribbean Netherlands (Bo
 naire\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius)\; applicant must be based in one of these r
 egions
END:VEVENT
