SUMMARY:Deadline: PhD Position in Space Law and Artificial Intelligence\, E
 O-TRUST project (Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam)
DESCRIPTION:A funded law PhD on the legal and ethical governance of AI-enab
 led Earth observation under the EU AI Act\, the proposed EU Space Act and 
 space\, security and military law\, within the EO-TRUST project. Requires 
 an LL.M. or equivalent law master's\, ideally in technology or AI law\, sp
 ace law\, EU law or public international law. Apply by 27 November 2026\, 
 23:59.\n\nOrganisation: Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam\, Faculty of Law\nLoc
 ation: Amsterdam\, Netherlands\nAward: EUR 3\,204 to 4\,051 gross per mont
 h (at least 0.8 FTE). No application fee.\nDuration: 1 year\, extendable t
 o 4 years\; starts 1 February 2027\n\nMore: https://workingat.vu.nl/vacanc
 ies/phd-position-in-space-law-and-artificial-intelligence-amsterdam-134604
 5?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://workingat.vu.nl/vacancies/phd-position-in-space-law-and-artific
 ial-intelligence-amsterdam-1346045?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&u
 tm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Amsterdam\, Netherlands
END:VEVENT
