SUMMARY:Deadline: PhD Position in Accountable and Responsible AI (Universit
 y of Amsterdam\, Informatics Institute)
DESCRIPTION:A technical PhD on building generative AI systems that meet EU 
 AI Act requirements for transparency\, human oversight and risk management
 \, including legal-tech agents and compliance support for SMEs. Requires a
  master's in computer science\, AI or a closely related field (not aimed a
 t law graduates). Deadline 15 November 2026\; the post may close earlier i
 f filled.\n\nOrganisation: University of Amsterdam\, Faculty of Science\, 
 Informatics Institute\nLocation: Amsterdam\, Netherlands\nAward: EUR 3\,20
 4 to 4\,051 gross per month plus 8% holiday and 8.3% year-end allowances. 
 No application fee.\nDuration: 4 years (initial 18-month contract)\, start
  as soon as possible\n\nMore: https://www.academictransfer.com/en/jobs/364
 855/phd-position-in-accountable-and-responsible-ai/?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.academictransfer.com/en/jobs/364855/phd-position-in-account
 able-and-responsible-ai/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
 referral
LOCATION:Amsterdam\, Netherlands
END:VEVENT
