 ndance films up to 25 minutes for its competitions\; other sections take V
 R\, stereoscopic and installation work. Deadline 30 June 2027.\n\nOrganisa
 tion: Cinedans\nLocation: Amsterdam\, Netherlands. International.\nAward: 
 EXCEPTION: NOT FUNDED (festival call). Fees EUR 20 (International Short Fi
 lm Competition) or EUR 15 (International Short Docs).\nDuration: Cinedans 
 FEST 2028\n\nMore: https://cinedans.mama.media/presentations/3441-open-cal
 l-fest-27-28/published?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
